  "translation": "This morning, I set out from home to go to school. There were many people outside the school. I met my classmate Xiao Li in front of the classroom. He asked me, \"What classes do you have today?\" I said, \"I have two math classes in the morning.\" He said, \"I have no class in the afternoon. Shall we go see a movie together?\" I said, \"Okay, but I need to go home first to eat.\" Then we went to the cafeteria together. There were many delicious things in the cafeteria. Each of us ate a piece of bread. In the afternoon, I went home to read. I often read in the study. Today I also read an interesting book. My elder sister also came home."
